meta {
  name: 04 MCP
  seq: 4
}

headers {
  Accept: application/json, text/event-stream
  Content-Type: application/json
}

docs {
  MCP over Streamable HTTP is JSON-RPC 2.0 sent as POST requests to /mcp.
  Order: initialize -> tools/list -> tools/call.
  The server runs stateless with JSON responses, so no session header is needed.
}
